          },
          {
            "level": 1,
            "name": "Shooting Irons",
            "description": "<p>You gain the Quick Draw Perk (p. 71) and, once per Round, you can make a Ranged attack against an attack that would hit. If you pass, reduce the damage dealt by the Target’s attack by your attack’s damage.</p>",
            "statBonusPoints": 0,
